      },
      {
        "path": "/data",
        "reason": "Feral conditional melee bonuses require negative hit points and are not always-on. Survival becomes a class skill, though runtime class skill target mapping needs checking.",
        "blocking": true
      },
      {
        "path": "/data",
        "reason": "Affinity for Magic grants +2 to spell-resistance penetration checks and dispel checks, not globally +2 caster level.",
        "blocking": true
      },
      {
        "path": "/data",
        "reason": "Can't Let Them Live and Tell adds movement only for charge, run, or withdraw; no permanent base speed increase.",
        "blocking": true
      },
      {
        "path": "/data",
        "reason": "Nature Inhabitant and Squalid both replace Survivalist; Nature Inhabitant and Can't Let Them Live and Tell both replace Stability. These alternatives are mutually exclusive.",
        "blocking": true
      },
      {
        "path": "/data",
        "reason": "Water resistance 5, senses, and conditional saving throws require independently reviewed sheet adapters.",
        "blocking": true
      }
